PRSL-AI Governance protects AI-provider independence.

AI providers are considered implementation components unless explicitly defined otherwise.

The architecture should permit:

Provider A
    ↓
Provider B
    ↓
Provider C


without redefining:

- @iriel
- Personal Intelligence Environment
- Identity
- Context
- Memory
- Privacy
- Human Control


